@local/computer-use README · English：Requires the official Cua driver (`irm https://cua.ai/driver/install.ps1 | iex`, installed at `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Programs\Cua\cua-driver\bin\cua-driver.exe`) or `CUA_DRIVER_BIN`. Not included here because it is a third-party 28 MB binary.

Not supported: clipboard, process kill, desktop-wide input, password/payment/permission dialogs.

Install: clone and run `plugin_manager` with `action: "install_bundle"` and the absolute folder path, then restart DSH.
